	(text "Start LED: D13 HIGH = on (also onboard LED).\n12 V LED from +12V_FUSED, NOT +12V_SW:\nit must blink while motor power is cut.\nQ1 TIP120 low side; tab = collector: insulate\nif mounted on metal. LED current limit: TBD.\nLance fault 500/500 ms, other 2000/2000 ms."
