	(text "Mega TX1 (D18) -> ESP32 RX; ESP32 TX -> Mega RX1 (D19).\nESP32 is 3.3 V: 5 V into it is over rating. 3.3 V into the Mega is marginal\n(check ATmega2560 VIH). LV rail = ESP32 3V3 (not drawn)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 368.3 274.32 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3bc0fd7e-a557-49fc-9ce8-15d79a8ca9ba")
	)
	(text "OPEN ITEMS (owner):\n1. 12 V supply current rating; wire gauges.\n2. Physical location of panel, key, start button; connectors per harness.\n3. Does the shield tie A4/A5 to SDA/SCL? (continuity check, power off)\n4. Relay board mounting and input polarity.\n5. Start LED current (built-in limit?); LED terminals separate from switch.\n6. Chain relay board contact wiring."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 368.3 307.34 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.5 1.5))
			(justify left top)
